# (e) without latency: the same market, and the strategy acts the moment it sees each change.
#
#   0   joins the ask with 1 lot (ack at 0)
#   20  sees the 100.10 asks pulled and cancels at once: cancelled at 20, before the buyer at 22
#   22  the buyer takes 1 of the 3 lots at 100.20
# No fill.

latency 0
end 50
data 0 snapshot bid 100.00 0.005 ask 100.10 0.002
send 0 o1 sell limit 100.10 0.001
data 20 depth ask 100.10 0 ask 100.20 0.003
cancel 20 o1
data 22 trade buy 100.20 0.001

queue_at 22 ask 100.20 = syn 0.002

expect 0 0 o1 ack
expect 20 20 o1 cancelled user
final position 0 cash 0 fees 0
